                                "sense_id": "595e7eaa-109b-316b-b5be-bf5c8b5e4a31",
                                "text": "For the execution, by disputes, there arose some difficulties, the Earl of Dorset alleging that if the arrears should be paid upon Dorsetshire, there would not remain money to satisfy the growing entertainments, which would much unsatisfy the […]"
                            },
                            {
