                                "sense_id": "595e7eaa-109b-316b-b5be-bf5c8b5e4a31",
                                "text": "[…] or imprisoned persons, supposed ghosts, for long periods or until almost the end of the story, with occasional references to them, unsatisfies the reader, unless he knows beforehand that all will be explained normally."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "021f319c-957f-4df4-aa13-2b69a6705660",
                                "sense_id": "595e7eaa-109b-316b-b5be-bf5c8b5e4a31",
                                "text": "Norm was thinking: I'd sure like to unsatisfy that bastard."
